    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped aboard in the Darkness, you and your teammates must <strong>survive, scavenge for supplies, and fight\u00a0</strong>against horrors lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Co-Op Survival</strong> \u2013 Work with your crew to survive fend off creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Dynamic Systems</strong> \u2013 Manage power, navigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 <strong>Procedural Horrors</strong> \u2013 Unpredictable threats emerge from the shadows<br>\ud83c\udfda <strong>Survive</strong> \u2013 Search through dark areas for supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99 <strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong> \u2013 Communicate in-game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Tense Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Navigate  where <strong>darkness hides more than just shadows.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc19 <strong>Relentless Creatures</strong> \u2013 Face evolving threats that grow stronger over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Teamwork is Essential</strong> \u2013 Survive together or perish alone.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As reality twists and fractures, your only hope is to <strong>survive\u00a0</strong>but will you ever truly escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>co-op survival horror</strong> experience where teamwork, resource management, and terror collide.</p>",
